{"version":1,"_note":"信息源页海报专用(tools/banner/dyn_dev.py),组件不用。只取 cloudflarestatus.com 公开接口,不带凭证。","actions":[{"action":"request","id":"st","params":{"url":"https://www.cloudflarestatus.com/api/v2/status.json","method":"GET","formatType":"json","timeout":"10000","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable","Accept":"application/json"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求屏障(勿删):request 之后紧邻的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并)。"},{"action":"request","id":"inc","params":{"url":"https://www.cloudflarestatus.com/api/v2/incidents/unresolved.json","method":"GET","formatType":"json","timeout":"10000","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable","Accept":"application/json"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求屏障(勿删):request 之后紧邻的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ind","value":"${st.status.indicator}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_fail","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${ind}),0),0,1)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${_fail}"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"cf_status_unreachable"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lv","value":"$[if::(eq::(${ind},none),0,if::(eq::(${ind},maintenance),1,if::(eq::(${ind},major),3,if::(eq::(${ind},critical),3,2))))]"},"_note":"0 正常 · 1 维护 · 2 部分降级(minor 与不认识的值)· 3 严重(major / critical)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nInc","value":"$[parseNumber::(length::(${inc.incidents}),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"top","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${inc.incidents[0].name},),[\\r\\n]+, )]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"top2","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${inc.incidents[1].name},),[\\r\\n]+, )]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasInc2","value":"$[if::(gt::(${nInc},1),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasInc","value":"$[if::(gt::(${nInc},0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"noInc","value":"$[if::(gt::(${nInc},0),0,1)]"}},{"action":"request","id":"raw","params":{"url":"https://www.cloudflarestatus.com/api/v2/components.json","method":"GET","formatType":"string","timeout":"10000","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable","Accept":"application/json"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求屏障(勿删):request 之后紧邻的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"reT","value":"\"group\":false"},"_note":"叶子组件(数据中心 + 产品服务);分组行是 group:true。components.json 约 175KB,只数不解析。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"reO","value":"\"status\":\"operational\"[^{}]*\"group\":false"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"reM","value":"\"status\":\"under_maintenance\"[^{}]*\"group\":false"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tot","value":"$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reT}))-1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nO","value":"$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reO}))-1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nM","value":"$[calc::(length::(split::(${raw},${reM}))-1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aff","value":"$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(${tot}-${nO}-${nM}),0),0)]"},"_note":"受影响 = 不是正常、也不是计划维护的叶子组件(维护是数据中心的日常,不算异常)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasC","value":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${tot},0),100),1,0)]"},"_note":"组件表没取到 / 格式变了 → 这一行不画,不影响药丸。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"gE","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(26+${nO}/max::(${tot},1)*286),0.0)]"},"_note":"组件条:正常 | 维护 | 异常 三段按数量占比(左→右),点坐标相对整卡。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"mE","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(${gE}+${nM}/max::(${tot},1)*286),0.0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"BG","value":"$[connect::(26\\,105\\,,${gE},\\,105)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"BM","value":"$[connect::(${gE},\\,105\\,,${mE},\\,105)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"BA","value":"$[connect::(${mE},\\,105\\,312\\,105)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasG","value":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${nO},0),0),${hasC},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasM","value":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${nM},0),0),${hasC},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasA","value":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${aff},0),0),${hasC},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"at","value":"$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"},"_note":"状态页没有「数据时刻」,用取数时刻作时间锚。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"1"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["ok","at","lv","nInc","top","top2","hasInc2","hasInc","noInc","tot","aff","hasC","BG","BM","BA","hasG","hasM","hasA"]}}]}
